I think you've been under
an inhuman amount of stress recently.

470
00:38:23.736 --> 00:38:26.113
And maybe you're just starting
to go a little, you know...

471
00:38:26.280 --> 00:38:28.449
<font color="#804040">(whistles)</font>
...a little cuckoo.

472
00:38:28.616 --> 00:38:32.662
But if I'm this crazy
and I can imagine all this,

473
00:38:32.829 --> 00:38:36.165
then I could easily have got so drunk
that I blacked out that night

474
00:38:36.332 --> 00:38:40.670
and killed Merrin,
and just forgot all about it, right?

475
00:38:57.728 --> 00:38:59.730
Mom?

476
00:39:03.943 --> 00:39:05.903
- Mom?
- <font color="#804040">(whirring)</font>

477
00:39:09.574 --> 00:39:11.576
I didn't know you were coming.

478
00:39:11.742 --> 00:39:14.120
I didn't know where else to go, Mom.

479
00:39:14.287 --> 00:39:17.164
Something really bad is happening to me.

480
00:39:22.336 --> 00:39:24.755
Oh, sweetheart.

481
00:39:26.632 --> 00:39:29.886
Why couldn't you go
somewhere else?

482
00:39:30.052 --> 00:39:32.471
What?
What do you mean?

483
00:39:32.638 --> 00:39:35.224
I don't want to hear
about all your problems.

484
00:39:35.391 --> 00:39:38.019
- I don't want to know.
- Mom...

485
00:39:38.185 --> 00:39:42.356
Sometimes, when you talk,
I just want to sing.

486
00:39:42.940 --> 00:39:44.734
<font color="#804040">(sings)</font>

487
00:39:44.901 --> 00:39:45.943
What are you doing? Mom?

488
00:39:46.110 --> 00:39:49.947
I want to hold my breath
until you just go away!

489
00:39:50.156 --> 00:39:51.157
<font color="#804040">(inhales deeply)</font>

490
00:39:52.658 --> 00:39:54.619
Jesus Christ, Mom, don't...

491
00:39:54.785 --> 00:39:56.037
Don't... Stop it!

492
00:39:56.203 --> 00:39:58.039
<font color="#804040">(exhales)</font>

493
00:40:00.291 --> 00:40:03.044
I want to write you a letter,
a really nice letter

494
00:40:03.210 --> 00:40:05.755
