495
00:40:05.922 --> 00:40:09.842
and how great it would be
for both of us if you would just go.

496
00:40:11.928 --> 00:40:13.387
But where? Where can I go?

497
00:40:13.554 --> 00:40:17.433
I don't know. Didn't you always
want to go hiking in Alaska?

498
00:40:17.600 --> 00:40:20.102
Didn't you want to go to Vietnam
to teach English?

499
00:40:20.269 --> 00:40:22.313
Those were things Merrin and I were
gonna do together, you know that.

500
00:40:22.480 --> 00:40:25.733
I don't care where you go,
just as long as I don't have to see you.

501
00:40:25.900 --> 00:40:29.362
Because every time I see you,
it just makes me so...

502
00:40:30.488 --> 00:40:32.156
...unhappy.

503
00:40:33.658 --> 00:40:36.827
I just want to be
happy again, sweetheart.

504
00:40:36.994 --> 00:40:38.496
Oh, I understand.

505
00:40:47.421 --> 00:40:50.132
And I don't want you
to be my son anymore.

506
00:40:55.972 --> 00:40:58.099
Are you gonna go away?

507
00:41:04.855 --> 00:41:08.693
Ig. I thought I heard you come in.

508
00:41:10.820 --> 00:41:13.572
Yeah, OK,
let me walk you through this, Dad.

509
00:41:13.739 --> 00:41:15.574
This is the part where
you tell me something awful

510
00:41:15.741 --> 00:41:17.785
