576
00:45:38.671 --> 00:45:40.089
Ah!

577
00:45:40.256 --> 00:45:42.758
Jesus Christ, AI, you don't want
to do that, you'll get arrested.

578
00:45:42.925 --> 00:45:44.843
I don't give a flying fuck
if I get arrested.

579
