581
00:45:52.977 --> 00:45:55.938
Can you not burn down the bar right now?
I need your help with something.

582
00:45:57.106 --> 00:45:59.483
If anyone knows anything
about who killed Merrin,

583
00:45:59.650 --> 00:46:01.694
you're gonna have to tell me now.

584
