Only thing I ever killed
was a couple of dogs.

585
00:46:13.622 --> 00:46:17.251
I run a dog-fighting ring
out of the supply room back there.

586
00:46:17.418 --> 00:46:18.752
Jesus, AI,
I don't want to know that.

587
00:46:18.919 --> 00:46:21.505
I've been unemployed for three months
and I hate my life,

588
00:46:21.672 --> 00:46:25.426
so, yeah, I can sure understand
wanting to kill someone.

589
00:46:25.592 --> 00:46:27.219
Rob, that's not what I meant.

590
00:46:27.386 --> 00:46:29.805
I really want to show everybody
my dick.

591
00:46:29.972 --> 00:46:32.057
Oh, don't...

592
00:46:33.517 --> 00:46:34.810
I want that all the time.

593
00:46:38.063 --> 00:46:39.565
I want that all the time.

594
00:46:39.732 --> 00:46:43.861
The only thing I know
is I got a cousin who's a cop.

595
00:46:44.028 --> 00:46:46.155
He knows who the new witness is.

596
00:46:47.156 --> 00:46:49.950
It's a waitress who served you
the night Merrin got killed.

597
00:46:50.117 --> 00:46:51.910
Said she saw you
drive back to the restaurant

598
00:46:52.077 --> 00:46:53.746
and drag Merrin into your car.

599
00:46:53.912 --> 00:46:55.456
Thanks a lot, Stan.

600
00:46:56.582 --> 00:46:59.752
<font color="#804040">(laughs, then whoops)</font>

601
00:47:02.129 --> 00:47:03.130
<font color="#804040">(explosion)</font>

602
00:47:06.717 --> 00:47:08.260
<font color="#804040">(laughing)</font>

603
00:47:18.395 --> 00:47:22.024
- <font color="#804040">(gagging)</font>
- Hey, my interview!

604
00:47:23.233 --> 00:47:25.611
Hey, my interview!

605
00:47:51.136 --> 00:47:53.389
OK.

606
00:47:53.555 --> 00:47:55.307
OK, guys, so,

607
00:47:55.474 --> 00:47:57.559
