to the diner at about 9:00.

608
00:47:57.726 --> 00:47:59.603
I will have hopefully
done the deed by then,

609
00:47:59.770 --> 00:48:01.897
- and then we can go out and celebrate.
- Fuck, yeah.

610
00:48:02.064 --> 00:48:04.316
You want me to bring any goodies?

611
00:48:04.483 --> 00:48:06.860
No. I think me and Merrin are
gonna be happy enough tomorrow night

612
