615
00:48:13.158 --> 00:48:16.578
And I am a state employee,
subject to random drug testing.

616
00:48:16.745 --> 00:48:18.997
- Sure you're not rushing into this?
- Rushing into it?

617
00:48:19.164 --> 00:48:22.292
Dude, how am I rushing into it?
We've been going out since we were kids.

618
00:48:41.520 --> 00:48:43.021
- Hi.
- Hey.

619
00:48:51.655 --> 00:48:53.407
Hey.

620
00:48:56.618 --> 00:48:58.454
Is everything all right?

621
00:49:00.831 --> 00:49:03.625
Hey. What's wrong, Merrin?

622
00:49:06.712 --> 00:49:11.967
I don't really know how to say this,
so I'm just gonna go ahead and say it.

623
00:49:14.178 --> 00:49:16.388
