from the radio station easy.

626
00:49:23.562 --> 00:49:27.149
- I want a change of scene, too.
- That's not what I'm talking about.

627
00:49:28.692 --> 00:49:31.487
I think that we need
to stop seeing each other.

628
00:49:31.653 --> 00:49:33.405
- Hey, lovebirds!
- What?

629
00:49:33.572 --> 00:49:35.240
You guys ready to order?

630
00:49:35.407 --> 00:49:37.659
Oh, I don't think
we've quite decided yet.

631
00:49:37.826 --> 00:49:39.661
OK, I'll come back.

632
00:49:41.038 --> 00:49:44.541
I don't understand.
I thought everything was going great.

633
00:49:45.876 --> 00:49:49.046
It's just that we haven't
had a chance to ever be apart.

634
00:49:49.213 --> 00:49:52.716
And I've never had the chance
to think about what I want for my life.

635
00:49:52.883 --> 00:49:55.177
Well, OK,
but I know what I want.

636
00:49:55.344 --> 00:49:57.888
I want the life we've been
dreaming about since we were kids.

637
00:49:58.055 --> 00:49:59.389
That's the problem.

638
00:49:59.556 --> 00:50:01.892
We've been dreaming about that
since we were kids.

639
00:50:02.059 --> 00:50:04.937
And we're adults now.
We need to start being practical.

640
00:50:05.103 --> 00:50:08.565
OK... I don't know
what you mean by that.

641
00:50:08.732 --> 00:50:12.027
I don't want to ever be the reason
for any of your regrets, Ig.

642
00:50:12.194 --> 00:50:14.947
But how many times
have we talked about getting married?

643
00:50:15.113 --> 00:50:17.658
How many times have we talked about
what we're gonna name our kids?

644
00:50:17.824 --> 00:50:19.368
I'm not even sure
if I want to have kids.

645
00:50:19.535 --> 00:50:24.540
What? Well, you sounded pretty into it
the last 8,000 times we talked about it.

646
00:50:27.626 --> 00:50:29.419
How many girls have you been with?

647
00:50:31.713 --> 00:50:33.090
You know the answer to that.

648
00:50:34.883 --> 00:50:36.885
- Just me.
- Yeah.

649
00:50:37.052 --> 00:50:42.641
No one does that, Ig.
No one on the whole planet does that.

650
00:50:43.642 --> 00:50:45.644
You need to see other people
so you can figure out

651
00:50:45.811 --> 00:50:47.563
