that you want to be with.

652
00:50:47.729 --> 00:50:49.773
I don't want to see other people.

653
00:50:49.940 --> 00:50:51.567
<font color="#804040">(thunder rumbles)</font>

654
00:50:51.733 --> 00:50:53.360
Is that what you want?

655
00:50:59.032 --> 00:51:00.492
Are you in love
with somebody else?

656
00:51:06.999 --> 00:51:08.792
And how far has it gone?

657
00:51:12.129 --> 00:51:14.298
Answer me!
How far has it gone?

658
00:51:15.173 --> 00:51:16.925
- Have you fucked him already?
- Please, Ig.

659
00:51:17.092 --> 00:51:20.012
No, tell me!
Tell me everything that happened.

660
00:51:20.178 --> 00:51:21.763
I need to know.
Have you fucked him already?

661
00:51:22.681 --> 00:51:24.975
- Why are you asking me this?
- Because I want to know!

662
00:51:25.142 --> 00:51:29.021
I want to know everything! It's gonna
make it easier for me to hate you!

663
00:51:35.360 --> 00:51:37.446
You deserve better.

664
00:51:38.363 --> 00:51:41.116
Finally, something we agree on.

665
00:51:50.626 --> 00:51:52.377
Please...

666
00:51:53.337 --> 00:51:55.380
