667
00:51:56.256 --> 00:51:58.634
I'm not in love with you anymore.

668
00:52:04.973 --> 00:52:08.101
Come on, please.
We're not done talking about this.

669
00:52:09.186 --> 00:52:10.729
Please, Ig.

670
00:52:12.731 --> 00:52:14.024
Please.

671
00:52:21.073 --> 00:52:22.282
Yeah, what, are you looking at?

672
00:52:22.449 --> 00:52:24.993
Sir, we're going to have to
ask you and your wife to leave.

673
00:52:25.160 --> 00:52:27.204
She's not my wife.
She's just someone I used to fuck!

674
00:52:27.371 --> 00:52:28.622
Hey, easy.

675
00:52:33.293 --> 00:52:34.795
Come on.

676
00:52:37.255 --> 00:52:39.591
Hey, Ig, how'd it go?
You already propose?

677
00:52:39.758 --> 00:52:42.969
- The party's over, Terry. Go home.
- What the hell are you talking about?

678
00:52:43.136 --> 00:52:45.555
Hey! Hey, I thought
we were gonna celebrate tonight.

679
00:52:45.722 --> 00:52:47.140
What's going on?

680
00:52:47.307 --> 00:52:50.143
Iggy, what the fuck are you doing? Ig!

681
00:53:05.409 --> 00:53:07.077
Merrin, you all right?

682
00:53:37.399 --> 00:53:40.944
Morning, Ig. Can you roll down
the window so we can talk?

683
00:53:44.531 --> 00:53:46.867
Hey, Meatbag, what's up?

684
00:53:47.033 --> 00:53:50.245
When was the last time
you saw Merrin, Ig?

685
00:53:50.412 --> 00:53:51.621
What's happened to her, Eric?

686
00:53:51.788 --> 00:53:54.666
What makes you think
something happened to her?

687
00:53:57.419 --> 00:53:59.171
Fuck, it's all my fault.

688
00:54:00.130 --> 00:54:03.717
Anything that happened to her,
it's all my fucking fault.

689
00:54:15.312 --> 00:54:18.815
So do you guys want a dessert?
Can I get you a dessert?

690
00:54:18.982 --> 00:54:22.277
- What have you got?
- I got a cherry pie.

691
00:54:22.444 --> 00:54:23.487
<font color="#804040">(laughing)</font>

692
00:54:25.864 --> 00:54:27.449
Oh. I gotta go.

693
00:54:28.950 --> 00:54:30.994
You can sit
wherever you want.

694
00:54:31.953 --> 00:54:34.748
Oh, wait, you're that guy, Ig Perrish.

695
00:54:34.915 --> 00:54:38.418
Yeah. I've heard you've been
telling lies about me to the police.

696
00:54:38.585 --> 00:54:40.670
Yeah, I have.

697
00:54:40.837 --> 00:54:43.173
And, you know, I don't even
feel a little bit bad about it.

698
00:54:43.340 --> 00:54:45.467
You want to tell me exactly
what you said to them?

699
00:54:47.093 --> 00:54:49.221
I told them that your girlfriend
forgot her jacket,

700
00:54:49.387 --> 00:54:50.847
so I followed her
into the parking lot,

701
