01:34:11.914 --> 01:34:13.958
<i>should be considered hearsay
and conjecture at this time.</i>

1169
01:34:14.125 --> 01:34:17.003
<i>- Nothing more.
- <font color="#804040">(reporter)</font> Just one more question.</i>

1170
01:34:17.170 --> 01:34:19.046
<i>Are you dragging the river?</i>

1171
01:34:19.213 --> 01:34:20.631
<i>Breaking news this evening</i>

1172
01:34:20.798 --> 01:34:23.009
<i>from the police force
in the Merrin Williams case.</i>

1173
01:34:23.176 --> 01:34:26.429
<i>We have heard tonight
that Ig Perrish</i>

1174
01:34:26.596 --> 01:34:29.473
<i>has reportedly driven his vehicle
into the bay.</i>

1175
01:34:29.640 --> 01:34:32.727
<i>Although, as of now,
no body has been recovered.</i>

1176
01:34:57.585 --> 01:34:59.253
<font color="#804040">(water splashing)</font>

1177
01:35:00.171 --> 01:35:01.797
<font color="#804040">(gasping)</font>

1178
01:35:21.692 --> 01:35:26.906
Well, one thing I'll say in my favor...
I am fucking hard to kill.

1179
01:35:28.407 --> 01:35:29.408
<font color="#804040">(hissing)</font>

1180
01:35:33.371 --> 01:35:34.622
<font color="#804040">(dog barking)</font>

1181
01:35:40.920 --> 01:35:43.631
Why the hell aren't you dead?

1182
01:35:47.009 --> 01:35:49.387
The truth is, I don't know the answer
to that question myself.

1183
01:35:49.553 --> 01:35:54.767
I have prayed for so long
for you to die,

1184
01:35:54.934 --> 01:35:57.395
but when I saw the news on the TV...

1185
01:35:59.480 --> 01:36:02.024
...it didn't help one bit.

1186
01:36:04.485 --> 01:36:08.072
I didn't kill her, Mr. Williams.

1187
01:36:09.699 --> 01:36:12.451
But you know who did it, don't you?

1188
01:36:16.539 --> 01:36:19.041
- You've gotta tell me.
- What will you do if I tell you?

1189
01:36:19.208 --> 01:36:21.002
You know what I'll do.

1190
01:36:21.168 --> 01:36:24.088
But this is my job.

1191
01:36:24.255 --> 01:36:27.466
People say you should always
do the right thing,

1192
01:36:27.633 --> 01:36:29.385
but sometimes there is no right thing.

1193
01:36:31.220 --> 01:36:32.763
And then...

1194
01:36:34.682 --> 01:36:37.935
Well, then, you just have to pick
the sin you can live with.

1195
01:36:43.983 --> 01:36:45.860
Why don't you come inside?

1196
01:36:51.198 --> 01:36:55.369
Yesterday, I was wandering
around the house and I found this.

1197
01:36:59.373 --> 01:37:04.587
I thought maybe I should give it to
the police, but that didn't feel right.

1198
01:37:08.591 --> 01:37:10.343
She wanted you to have this.

1199
01:37:16.182 --> 01:37:17.767
Thank you.

1200
01:37:21.062 --> 01:37:24.940
And there's something
I would like to give you.

1201
01:37:27.651 --> 01:37:29.070
Here.

1202
01:37:33.407 --> 01:37:36.577
Merrin's mother, she gave this to her
just before she...

1203
01:37:38.621 --> 01:37:40.831
You know, son, I think...

1204
01:37:42.875 --> 01:37:45.628
...I think you need this
even more than I do.

1205
01:37:47.254 --> 01:37:49.673
I think you need her
to keep you safe.

1206
01:38:20.287 --> 01:38:25.251
Well, now, I guess maybe that's
some kind of blessing after all.

1207
01:38:36.971 --> 01:38:39.807
<i><font color="#804040">(Ig)</font> The horns weren't a curse,
but a blessing.</i>

1208
01:38:39.974 --> 01:38:41.851
<i>They had guided me this far.</i>

1209
01:38:43.477 --> 01:38:45.980
<i>And when I put on her cross,</i>

1210
01:38:46.147 --> 01:38:48.983
<i>I could feel her
protecting me again.</i>

1211
01:39:58.177 --> 01:39:59.637
<i>"Dear Ig:</i>

1212
01:40:01.222 --> 01:40:03.933
You'll never read this
while I'm alive.

1213
01:40:05.601 --> 01:40:08.812
<i><font color="#804040">(Merrin)</font> I'm not even sure
I want you to read it after I'm dead.</i>

1214
01:40:11.482 --> 01:40:14.151
<i>I think you're gonna ask me
to marry you soon.</i>

1215
01:40:15.236 --> 01:40:18.280
<i>You don't know how much
I want to say yes.</i>

1216
01:40:20.282 --> 01:40:21.700
<i>But I can't.</i>

1217
01:40:22.826 --> 01:40:25.746
<i>The thing is, Ig, I'm very sick.</i>

1218
01:40:25.913 --> 01:40:29.708
<i>The sort of cancer I have
is the kind that runs in families.</i>

1219
01:40:31.710 --> 01:40:37.091
<i>I saw my mother go through it,
and I saw what it did to my father.</i>

1220
01:40:37.258 --> 01:40:41.554
<i>If I tell you I'm sick, you're just
gonna want to marry me even more,</i>

1221
01:40:41.720 --> 01:40:45.140
<i>and I'll be weak and say yes.</i>

1222
01:40:45.307 --> 01:40:47.309
<i>Then you'll give up your future</i>

1223
01:40:47.476 --> 01:40:51.564
<i>and be shackled to me
as I go through hell and die anyway.</i>

1224
01:40:51.730 --> 01:40:54.441
<i>I won't put you through it.</i>

1225
01:40:54.608 --> 01:40:57.611
<i>I love you too much.</i>

1226
01:40:57.778 --> 01:41:01.615
<i>My plan is to hurt you just enough
to push you away.</i>

1227
01:41:01.782 --> 01:41:04.702
<i>And hopefully, one day,
you can forgive me.</i>

1228
01:41:05.661 --> 01:41:08.289
<i>And you'll move on to someone else.</i>

1229
01:41:08.455 --> 01:41:12.459
<i>You'll have children, grandchildren
and great-grandchildren.</i>

1230
01:41:12.626 --> 01:41:16.255
<i>You'll go for long walks
in the woods.</i>

1231
01:41:16.422 --> 01:41:20.384
<i>On one of these walks,
when you're very old,</i>

1232
01:41:20.551 --> 01:41:25.222
<i>you'll find yourself at a tree,
with a house in its branches.</i>

1233
01:41:25.389 --> 01:41:27.016
<i>I'll be waiting for you there.</i>

1234
01:41:27.182 --> 01:41:31.562
<i>I'll be waiting by candlelight
in our tree house,</i>

1235
01:41:31.729 --> 01:41:35.190
<i>shining the light
of my cross into your eyes,</i>

1236
01:41:35.357 --> 01:41:38.569
<i>the first message I ever sent you.</i>

1237
01:41:38.736 --> 01:41:40.738
<i>- Us. "</i>
- "Us."

1238
01:41:42.072 --> 01:41:44.783
<i><font color="#804040">(Merrin)</font> "I love you, Iggy Perrish.</i>

1239
01:41:44.950 --> 01:41:47.661
<i>Your girl, Merrin. "</i>

1240
01:42:04.511 --> 01:42:08.682
- Iggy... you're alive.
- <font color="#804040">(Ig)</font> No, don't.

1241
01:42:11.435 --> 01:42:15.814
Iggy, we have to clear your name.

1242
01:42:17.149 --> 01:42:19.360
We need to figure out
who really killed Merrin.

1243
01:42:19.526 --> 01:42:21.320
It was Lee.

1244
01:42:23.447 --> 01:42:26.617
If you're going after Lee,
then I am coming with you.

1245
01:42:26.784 --> 01:42:28.118
Terry, you're not strong enough
for that.

1246
01:42:28.285 --> 01:42:30.621
I am not leaving you.

1247
01:42:31.789 --> 01:42:35.709
I made myself a promise:
Never again.

1248
01:42:41.674 --> 01:42:43.842
If anything happens to me,
I need to know you're all right,

1249
01:42:44.009 --> 01:42:46.679
for Mom and Dad's sake.

1250
01:43:05.864 --> 01:43:08.283
- I'll be damned.
- You and me both.

1251
01:43:10.119 --> 01:43:11.495
What are you doing out here?

1252
01:43:11.662 --> 01:43:15.624
You don't remember anything
that happened between us, do you?

1253
01:43:16.458 --> 01:43:17.960
You want to come inside?

1254
01:43:18.127 --> 01:43:21.588
No, actually, I was hoping
we could go for a walk.

1255
01:43:21.755 --> 01:43:23.298
Nobody's looking for me.

1256
01:43:23.465 --> 01:43:25.342
Pretty much everybody in town
thinks I'm dead.

1257
01:43:25.509 --> 01:43:26.760
No shit.

1258
01:43:27.761 --> 01:43:30.723
- So what do you say?
- Just a walk?

1259
01:43:30.889 --> 01:43:32.433
Yeah.

1260
01:43:37.896 --> 01:43:39.148
OK.

1261
01:43:59.251 --> 01:44:02.004
- Why'd you bring us here?
- You know why.

1262
01:44:05.090 --> 01:44:07.259
Is this where you killed Merrin?

1263
01:44:11.764 --> 01:44:12.973
What happened to you?

1264
01:44:14.767 --> 01:44:16.727
You lost your mind?

1265
01:44:16.894 --> 01:44:21.106
Things are going to go a lot easier
for both of us if you don't lie to me.

1266
01:44:30.783 --> 01:44:32.242
Ig...

1267
01:44:36.121 --> 01:44:39.124
I'm your best friend.
You've known me your whole life.

1268
01:44:39.291 --> 01:44:41.168
You think I had something
to do with this?

1269
01:44:41.335 --> 01:44:45.714
Believe me,
all I want to do is kill you.

1270
01:44:48.050 --> 01:44:50.260
But I am trying to be human.

1271
01:44:51.220 --> 01:44:54.556
I am trying to be the kind of man
Merrin wanted me to be.

1272
01:44:54.723 --> 01:44:58.852
And so I'm giving you this chance
to do the right thing.

1273
01:45:02.898 --> 01:45:04.525
We are gonna go down
to the police station.

1274
01:45:04.691 --> 01:45:06.860
- OK.
- You are gonna turn yourself in.

1275
01:45:07.027 --> 01:45:08.320
<font color="#804040">(gun cocking)</font>

1276
01:45:08.487 --> 01:45:12.199
Keep your hands where I can see them,
Lee. Don't do anything stupid.

1277
01:45:13.450 --> 01:45:14.576
Terry.

1278
01:45:14.743 --> 01:45:16.870
What the fuck
are you doing here, Terry?

1279
01:45:17.037 --> 01:45:18.413
Terry came to talk to me just now.

1280
01:45:19.456 --> 01:45:21.250
Told me some things
about the night Merrin died.

1281
01:45:21.416 --> 01:45:23.168
Anything he said,
he was just trying to save his own ass.

1282
01:45:23.335 --> 01:45:25.295
- Go fuck yourself.
- Yeah, fuck you, too.

1283
01:45:25.462 --> 01:45:30.717
You told everybody that Ig confessed
to you and then killed himself.

1284
01:45:32.135 --> 01:45:34.012
At least one of those things
isn't true.

1285
01:45:34.888 --> 01:45:37.391
So now I'm wondering
what else you were lying to me about.

1286
01:45:37.558 --> 01:45:39.643
Fuck.

1287
01:45:42.771 --> 01:45:43.981
I'm sorry.

1288
01:45:46.775 --> 01:45:47.901
I'm sorry.

1289
01:45:49.236 --> 01:45:50.988
- I'm so sorry.
- Lee.

1290
01:45:51.154 --> 01:45:52.239
OK.

1291
01:45:53.866 --> 01:45:55.659
I didn't mean to hurt her.

1292
01:45:57.160 --> 01:45:58.954
It was a mistake, I'm sorry.

1293
01:46:00.038 --> 01:46:01.081
I'm sorry.

1294
01:46:02.708 --> 01:46:05.419
- Look, I want to do the right thing.
- OK.

1295
01:46:08.922 --> 01:46:10.382
OK, I'm gonna fix all of this, OK?

1296
01:46:10.549 --> 01:46:12.509
- You're doing good.
- OK.

1297
01:46:13.594 --> 01:46:14.720
- OK.
- That's right.

1298
01:46:14.887 --> 01:46:16.597
We've been friends a long time.

1299
01:46:18.473 --> 01:46:20.767
<font color="#804040">(grunting)</font>

1300
01:46:21.977 --> 01:46:24.521
Fuck, Lee, put the goddamn gun down.

1301
01:46:26.356 --> 01:46:27.816
<font color="#804040">(screaming)</font>

1302
01:46:27.983 --> 01:46:29.234
<font color="#804040">(gunshot)</font>

1303
01:46:29.401 --> 01:46:30.485
Terry!

1304
01:46:34.031 --> 01:46:35.032
Jesus!

1305
01:46:35.198 --> 01:46:37.367
<font color="#804040">(laughing)</font>

1306
01:46:42.456 --> 01:46:46.001
Back the fuck up.
Back the fuck up.

1307
01:46:47.085 --> 01:46:51.173
OK! OK. OK.

1308
01:46:51.340 --> 01:46:53.133
- Whoo!
- <font color="#804040">(Terry grunting)</font>

1309
01:46:54.760 --> 01:46:56.428
I'm so sorry, Merrin.

1310
01:46:56.595 --> 01:46:58.138
I'll see you soon.

1311
01:47:09.483 --> 01:47:11.818
<font color="#804040">(screaming)</font>

1312
01:48:00.575 --> 01:48:04.079
Holy fuck! No!

1313
01:48:10.252 --> 01:48:11.712
<font color="#804040">(grunts)</font>

1314
01:48:28.437 --> 01:48:31.314
Please, Ig...

1315
01:48:38.697 --> 01:48:39.698
<font color="#804040">(groans)</font>

1316
01:49:01.887 --> 01:49:03.472
<font color="#804040">(screaming)</font>

1317
01:49:13.231 --> 01:49:16.193
<font color="#804040">(gasping)</font>

1318
01:50:00.487 --> 01:50:02.864
<font color="#804040">(gasping)</font>

1319
01:50:44.239 --> 01:50:45.240
<font color="#804040">(thud)</font>

1320
01:50:53.707 --> 01:50:55.834
<font color="#804040">(gasping)</font>

1321
01:51:00.046 --> 01:51:03.258
<font color="#804040">(panting)</font>

1322
01:51:08.972 --> 01:51:11.016
<font color="#804040">(groaning)</font>

1323
01:51:15.437 --> 01:51:17.189
<font color="#804040">(groaning)</font>

1324
01:51:21.818 --> 01:51:23.570
<font color="#804040">(grunting)</font>

1325
01:51:54.434 --> 01:51:55.852
<font color="#804040">(Merrin's faint laughter)</font>

1326
01:51:58.438 --> 01:51:59.773
Iggy.

1327
01:52:12.035 --> 01:52:15.288
<i><font color="#804040">(Ig)</font> In the end,
I embraced the horns.</i>

1328
01:52:15.455 --> 01:52:19.876
<i>Like an angel who fell to earth,
I became a devil one last time.</i>

1329
01:52:22.087 --> 01:52:24.506
<i>But revenge is all-consuming,</i>

1330
01:52:24.673 --> 01:52:28.510
<i>and my time has come to return to you,
so we can be together again.</i>

1331
01:52:28.677 --> 01:52:30.595
<i><font color="#804040">(Merrin laughs faintly)</font></i>

1332
01:52:35.058 --> 01:52:37.769
<font color="#804040">(♪ Sunset Rubdown:
"Shut Up I Am Dreaming Of Places

1333
01:52:37.936 --> 01:52:39.562
<font color="#804040">(Where Lovers Have Wings")</font>

1334
01:52:42.107 --> 01:52:44.067
<font color="#804040">(Ig)</font> No, no, I swear.

1335
01:52:44.234 --> 01:52:49.114
<i><font color="#804040">(Ig narrating)</font> I mean, if this isn't
paradise, I don't know what is.</i>

1336
01:52:56.788 --> 01:52:58.665
Are you horny?

1337
01:52:58.832 --> 01:53:01.042
Mmm. I'm getting warmer.

1338
01:53:01.209 --> 01:53:03.753
Oh. Fine.

1339
01:53:03.920 --> 01:53:05.797
<font color="#804040">(both laugh)</font>

1340
01:53:05.964 --> 01:53:08.466
- No.
- Yes.

1341
01:53:08.633 --> 01:53:10.093
No.

1342
01:53:10.635 --> 01:53:12.721
<font color="#804040">(giggling)</font>

1343
01:53:21.688 --> 01:53:24.566
I'm gonna love you
for the rest of my life.

1344
01:53:30.905 --> 01:53:33.325
Just love me
for the rest of mine.

1345
01:53:33.491 --> 01:53:35.994
<font color="#804040">(song continues)</font>
